Subject: [PATCH] Carpet: furnace, TNT and inventory transfer settings

Adapted from Lophine 7a51f49a512f1b5465f15a905d3704754e4bed02, Minecraft patches 0131-0134.
Uses Paper inventory and smelting events; no dispenser or creative-removal feature edits.
